{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45641","headline":"哭灵一上人 · 贯休","name":"哭灵一上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一公何不在，空有远公名。\n共说岑山路，今时不可行。\n旧房松更老，新塔草初生。\n经论传缁侣，文章遍墨卿。\n禅林枝干折，法宇栋梁倾。\n谁俊修僧史，应知传已成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}